		(property "Function" "RX_OCT in two halves: TX_OCT taken as /STB4 rises (the start of cell 5, mid-frame), then onto the frame edge (TX_CLK rises).  Each D changes well away from its clock, so RX_OCT no longer races the clock card's '4040 ripple; both clocks come off the stack"
